  "question": {
    "text": "Consider a thin square sheet of side $L$ and thickness $t$, made of a material of resistivity $\\rho$. The resistance between two opposite faces, shown by the shaded areas in the figure is\n<img src=\"assets\\qt0022_a9a7fd4bef04.png\"><br>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "\ndirectly proportional to $L$\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\ndirectly proportional to $t$\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\nindependent of $L$\n",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "\nindependent of $t$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$R=\\frac{\\rho(L)}{A}=\\frac{\\rho L}{t L}=\\frac{\\rho}{t}$ ie, $R$ is independent of $L$. Hence the correct option is (c)."
  }
